Package: tiltback-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: tiltback (= ${binary:Version}), systemd, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell
Enhances: gnome-shell
Description: GNOME/Mutter HID rebind helper for TiltBack
 Ships /usr/libexec/tiltback/rebind-hid.sh and enables
 tiltback-rebind.path so follow can reopen evdev after a udev
 calibration write without a password prompt. Same helper as
 Alpine tiltback-gnome. Install this package on GNOME.
